---
id: KelolaShiftOverride-TambahShiftOverride
title: Kelola Shift Override - Tambah Shift Override
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Manager
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as ShiftOverrideController
    participant SO as ShiftOverride Model
    participant DB as Database

    HR->>UI: Klik tombol "Tambah Shift Override"
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan form input (pilih pegawai, shift override, tanggal, alasan)
    HR->>UI: Isi form dan klik Simpan
    UI->>C: POST /admin/shift-overrides
    note over C: Validasi: pegawai ada, shift ada, tanggal valid
    alt Validasi berhasil
        C->>SO: Create shift override baru
        SO->>DB: INSERT INTO shift_overrides (worker_id, shift_id, date, reason, created_by, created_at)
        DB-->>SO: Override berhasil disimpan
        SO-->>C: New override instance
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>HR: Notifikasi berhasil, refresh tabel
    else Validasi gagal
        C-->>UI: Response error dengan pesan validasi
        UI-->>HR: Tampilkan pesan error
    end

